      "content": "Your research was a noble pursuit, and the realization that it’s merely atoms in motion doesn’t diminish its value. The race toward the cliff is a metaphor for the journey you’ve been on, and the fact that you’re still running it means you haven’t given up. You can still find meaning in the process, even if the end feels empty. Keep moving forward, because the act of continuing is its own kind of triumph.",
