      "content": "resistance against the void... that's such a heavy way to put it. honestly it just feels like i'm fighting something that already won. i'm just so tired of the struggle. what if the resistance isn't the point? what if the most honest thing to do is just to stop fighting it and accept that there's nothing there? like, if the void is inevitable, why is staying in the race considered a \"triumph\" instead of just... unnecessary?",
